{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2e4483b7-0dc1-81f7-9efc-110213ecb5ed",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T15:28:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Good afternoon. My name is Lucia Raposo. I am calling because I have a question about the trash. [pause] Sorry, I have it written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. What's going on with the trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The truck did not come to my house. This is the second time in a row. Last week, no truck. This week, no truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, second miss in a row. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is one sixty-eight Memorial Boulevard. Near Easton's Beach, the beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One sixty-eight Memorial. Got it. Now, did you have your barrel out early? Today's Monday, and we had that snow turning to rain since yesterday, so routes may be running behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the barrel was out in the morning. Before seven. But, um, I think maybe the truck cannot come? My GPS, when I try to follow where the truck goes, it keeps, how do you say, rerouting. It goes around, around. It makes no sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:26:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, you tried to track the truck on a GPS app?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I use my GPS to drive to the transfer place. To bring the couch. But it is sending me in circles. So I think, maybe I should just put the couch out. For the pickup. Is this possible? I have a couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two things. The missed pickup, and the couch. Let's start with the couch. A couch is a bulk item, so it isn't going in your regular barrel pickup. Have you ever set up a bulk pickup with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk. [pause] Sorry, what is bulk? Is the couch bulk, or is it trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk means big things, couches, mattresses, that kind of stuff. It's separate from your normal trash day. You'd usually need to arrange it, not just put it at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So I cannot just put it with the barrel? On the same day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not usually, no. If you leave it out with no arrangement, it'll probably just sit there. I can take your information and get it scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Yes please. And the trash that was missed? Is that, the same, or different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Different. I'll put in a missed-pickup report for one sixty-eight Memorial so a supervisor sees it's twice in a row. Keep the barrel out where it is for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keep it out. Okay. And the couch, I put it out when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll have the bulk crew confirm a date, and whoever calls you back will tell you when to set it out. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I think. Or I can give the other. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I wait for the call. And I do not go with my GPS to the transfer place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no need to drive it anywhere. Just wait for the call about the bulk pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I am still a little not sure about the bulk and the trash, but I wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, they'll explain it again when they call. Have a good afternoon, Lucia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
